  /* Postcard layout example 03 ships its stamp inline, the same way the
     railway logo and frame ornaments do. Layout examples never embed image
     bytes themselves, and fetching the file at apply time is not an option
     because the editor also runs straight off the file system, where a
     same-origin fetch is blocked. */
