        "quote": "WRITE\nEXAMPLE TEXT\n",
        "speaker": "NOCTURNE CINEMA",
        "handwrittenNote": "Every quiet mile leaves a little light.\nWhat fades from view still travels with us.\nSome journeys remain long after arrival.",
